              "instruction": "havā badallī kī bāḷālā paḍsaṁ hotaṁ. — When the weather changes the baby gets a runny cold.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *havā badallī kī bāḷālā paḍsaṁ hotaṁ.* — When the weather changes the baby gets a runny cold.]"
